      "content": "I'm really not condoning those thoughts as anything to even consider, but I'm also here to listen and support you through this. It's okay to feel like you're at your limit when it comes to coping with overwhelming emotions. Has it been possible to speak with a mental health professional, someone specializing in executive functioning or someone who can provide guidance on depression at your school or community health center? It's crucial to reach out to a professional who can work with you to find strategies tailored to your experience. It's a brave and important step.",
